This copy of Football Ad Blocker was put here by its installer.

Because this file exists next to the adblock folder, the app keeps everything it writes -
config.toml, recordings (sessions), learned graphics, logs, ui_state.json - in

    %LOCALAPPDATA%\FootballAdBlocker

instead of next to the program (the Start menu has a shortcut to that folder). Delete this file
to keep them next to the program instead, or set the environment variable
FOOTBALL_AD_BLOCKER_DATA to put them anywhere else.
